# AI coding assistants
# Tool folders, context files, and MCP configs at the repository root are a
# contributor's personal setup and stay out of the repo. Several labs ship tool
# configuration on purpose (chapter-05 .kiro/, chapter-06 .agents/, chapter-07
# .cursor/rules/, chapter-08 .claude/); these root-anchored rules leave them alone.
/.claude/
/.kiro/
/.cursor/
/.agents/
/.agent/
/.antigravity/
/.gemini/
/.windsurf/
/.codex/
/.continue/
/.amazonq/
/.junie/
/.roo/
/.github/copilot-instructions.md
/.github/instructions/
/.github/prompts/
/.mcp.json
/CLAUDE.md
/AGENTS.md
/GEMINI.md
/.cursorrules
/.windsurfrules
/.clinerules
